line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: How do I safely test the Dynamic flow?</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></strong>Send yourself a test email and click the link within 5 minutes of delivery, or use a brand\u2011new contact (created less than 1 hour ago). You should see an email verification prompt; normal clicks should unsubscribe instantly.</p><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Does my selected flow apply to all emails campaigns?</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Yes. The flow is set at the account level. All emails sent from that account honor the current selection until you change it.</p><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizin