sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"attachment-thumb ember-view\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004535-how-to-set-up-an-e-commerce-online-store", "title": "How to Set Up an E-Commerce Online Store", "folder": "Ecommerce", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546923/original/M-Nb20dNfs4DsPcpfxXVGTVbmCLzKZZIlgbe4c.jpg?1738039747", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546925/original/X2QKQWgf-LbzY56G6AIMrAvaYWYa0EWORgbe4c.jpg?1738039747", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546922/original/FMv-_p7jBPcZU9buUHrkLuxvTU3KOiW7eA05bf.jpg?1738039746", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546928/original/uIRDlZvONh0Mi5vjOULf36dRAmdchfHkSgcbea.jpg?1738039748", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546930/original/2qwHsnZdIvqpHcHpXOdt9jkcVuspaCkorAc5e8.jpg?1738039749", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546931/original/4JVkup31rPgypTdkNoxRIpqCw4KisQROyAc5e8.jpg?1738039749", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546926/original/yAAR3KZv0c4lMmzEPenRGKzlBgaO8qXLOgcbea.jpg?1738039748", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546929/original/xLiwvP9rRdAW6QLHUHQ3etUGETVRnHpVVwcbea.jpg?1738039748", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546924/original/NUTbHDpnQgmB-tXHjX6hDSPbdqjPhm6N2Qbe4c.jpg?1738039747", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546927/original/y8qyJJnk0FMY3uymxSxd1XTm1a1wFdQLKgcbea.jpg?1738039748"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><ul><ul><li><a href=\"#TABLE-OF-CONTENTS\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a></li></ul></ul><li><a href=\"#What-is-an-Online-Store?\">What is an Online Store?</a></li><li><a href=\"#Setting-Up-Your-e-Commerce-Store\">Setting Up Your e-Commerce Store</a><ul><li><a href=\"#1.-Create-and-configure-products-to-display-in-the-Online-store\">1. Create and configure products to display in the Online store</a></li><li><a href=\"#2.-Activating-and-Editing-your-online-store-on-your-website\">2. Activating and Editing your online store on your website</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Tracking-order-submissions-and-payments-made-on-the-online-store\">Tracking order submissions and payments made on the online store</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#3.-Fulfill-orders-and-send-shipment-details-to-your-customers\">3. Fulfill orders and send shipment details to your customers</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Additional-notes-while-creating-an-online-store\">Additional notes while creating an online store</a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Frequently-Asked-Questions-(FAQs)\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Can-I-sell-recurring-products-in-my-online-store?\">Can I sell recurring products in my online store?</a></li><li><a href=\"#I-have-created-a-store-for-test-purposes.-How-do-I-delete-it-now?\">I have created a store for test purposes. How do I delete it now?</a></li><li><a href=\"#Users-will-be-able-to-delete-a-store-by-deleting-any-of-the-automatically-added-pages.-If-they-confirm,-all-data-related-to-the-store-will-be-lostIs-it-possible-to-have-different-pricing-for-different-variants-of-a-product?\">Users will be able to delete a store by deleting any of the automatically added pages. If they confirm, all data related to the store will be lostIs it possible to have different pricing for different variants of a product?</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-do-I-mark-the-orders-created-as-fulfilled?-How-do-I-share-shipment-details-with-my-customer?\">How do I mark the orders created as fulfilled? How do I share shipment details with my customer?</a></li><li><a href=\"#Can-I-create-multiple-stores-within-the-same-location?\">Can I create multiple stores within the same location?</a></li></ul></li></ul><hr style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; user-select: none; clear: both; break-after: page; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><p class=\"tdfocus-1699374034576\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-is-an-Online-Store?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 2em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">What is an Online Store?</h1><p class=\"tdfocus-1699373713385\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">An online store is a virtual platform that allows businesses to sell products or services to customers globally. It enables customers to browse, select, and purchase items from the comfort of their own homes using a computer or mobile device.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1699374052799\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1699374062183\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Importance of an Online Store</strong></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Global Reach</strong>: Reach customers worldwide, expanding your market beyond geographical limitations.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Convenience</strong>: Customers can shop anytime, anywhere, increasing accessibility and convenience.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Reduced Overheads</strong>: Eliminate costs associated with physical storefronts and gain flexibility in operations.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Automated Transactions</strong>: Streamline the sales process with automated payment processing and order management.</li></ol><p class=\"tdfocus-1699373774354\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1699373774354\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h1 class=\"tdfocus-1699373774354\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Setting-Up-Your-e-Commerce-Store\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 2em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Setting Up Your e-Commerce Store</h1><p class=\"tdfocus-1699373774354\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Let's walk through the steps of setting up and using your own e-commerce Online Store.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1699373774354\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"1.-Create-and-configure-products-to-display-in-the-Online-store\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1699373768164\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">1. Create and configure products to display in the Online store</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Businesses will be able to create and configure store products under Payments -&gt; Products. This will allow configuring Product names, and descriptions, attaching product images and videos, defining the pricing, and configuring variants, if any.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546923/original/M-Nb20dNfs4DsPcpfxXVGTVbmCLzKZZIlgbe4c.jpg?1738039747\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155040546923\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\">Business users will be able to make use of the toggle at the top while creating a product to define the products that are to be displayed in the online store.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546925/original/X2QKQWgf-LbzY56G6AIMrAvaYWYa0EWORgbe4c.jpg?1738039747\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155040546925\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"line\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: block; color: rgb(26, 21, 35); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; text-align: start;\">Additionally, businesses will now be able to have 3 core functionalities required for presenting products/services in their online store</div><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; line-height: 17px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 14px; list-style: outside decimal; color: rgb(26, 21, 35); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; text-align: start;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><div class=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: inline; font-weight: 700;\">Enable rich text description</div>&nbsp;- Businesses will be able to provide a rich text description for the products they are offering, including formatting, alignment, Bold, and Italics for emphasis on a few aspects, bulleted lists, or table elements. This description for the product will auto-populate on the Product details page</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><div class=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: inline; font-weight: 700;\">Attach multiple images/videos for products</div>&nbsp;- Displaying appropriate images and videos for products is a crucial part of your e-commerce store. Businesses will be able to attach multiple images and videos to products</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><div class=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: inline; font-weight: 700;\">Create variants for products</div>&nbsp;- Businesses will now be able to add variants like Size/Color/Material etc. for the products they configure. This will allow selling different variant options for the same product along with their customized prices</li></ol><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546922/original/FMv-_p7jBPcZU9buUHrkLuxvTU3KOiW7eA05bf.jpg?1738039746\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155040546922\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1699373851573\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"2.-Activating-and-Editing-your-online-store-on-your-website\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1699373849167\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">2. Activating and Editing your online store on your website</strong></h2><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; line-height: 17px; list-style: outside disc; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(26, 21, 35); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; text-align: start;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1699373868664\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">An online store can be added both to an existing website as well as to a new website being created from scratch</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">Businesses will have the option to activate an online store by clicking on the&nbsp;<div class=\"inlineCodeBlock\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 2px 6px; border: 0px; display: inline; font-family: &quot;Roboto Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 6px;\">+</div>icon to add elements inside the website builder<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546928/original/uIRDlZvONh0Mi5vjOULf36dRAmdchfHkSgcbea.jpg?1738039748\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155040546928\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546930/original/2qwHsnZdIvqpHcHpXOdt9jkcVuspaCkorAc5e8.jpg?1738039749\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155040546930\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><div class=\"line\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: block; color: rgb(26, 21, 35); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; text-align: start;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">When an online store is added to a website, 5 pages are added by default to the website which will form the building blocks for your store. Businesses will be able to add any other kind of elements around the store elements that will help them in giving an overall customized experience to their customers that suits their brand needs</div><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; line-height: 17px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 14px; list-style: outside decimal; color: rgb(26, 21, 35); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; text-align: start;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><div class=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: inline; font-weight: 700;\">Products list page&nbsp;</div>- This will contain the element to showcase all your products or services to your customers.</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><div class=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: inline; font-weight: 700;\">Product details page</div>&nbsp;- This will allow the presentation of rich text product descriptions that contain useful information beneficial while making a purchase</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><div class=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: inline; font-weight: 700;\">Cart page</div>&nbsp;- This will allow customers to have a summary of the items they intend to purchase, add or remove any services before proceeding to checkout</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><div class=\"bold\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: inline; font-weight: 700;\">Checkout page</div>&nbsp;- This will allow the potential leads/customers to enter their shipping information, email, and other details, apply any coupon codes, and make an online payment using a card, Apple Pay, or Google Pay</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><div class=\"bold\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: inline; font-weight: 700;\">Thank you page</div>- This will allow the business to display an order confirmation automatically after the payment is successfully made for the purchase<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546931/original/4JVkup31rPgypTdkNoxRIpqCw4KisQROyAc5e8.jpg?1738039749\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155040546931\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></li></ol><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"line\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: block; color: rgb(26, 21, 35); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; text-align: start;\">Users will be able to format the elements added by default to match the brand aesthetics of their overall website. Each element will have General and Advanced settings for formatting.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></div><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546926/original/yAAR3KZv0c4lMmzEPenRGKzlBgaO8qXLOgcbea.jpg?1738039748\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155040546926\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Tracking-order-submissions-and-payments-made-on-the-online-store\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Tracking order submissions and payments made on the online store</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Businesses will be able to track all orders placed on the online store along with the payments made by navigating to Payments -&gt; Orders and Payments -&gt; Transactions. Businesses will also be able to process any refunds using the same</p><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1699373911003\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"3.-Fulfill-orders-and-send-shipment-details-to-your-customers\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">3. Fulfill orders and send shipment details to your customers</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1699373911978\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Businesses will also be able to mark orders as fulfilled and share shipment/tracking details with customers. By default, any order placed on the online store would be in an unfulfilled state.&nbsp;</strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Business users will have the ability to attach a tracking number, provider, and URL to track the status of the shipment. When an order is marked as fulfilled, an entry related to the fulfillment will be included in the order details, highlighting the date on which fulfillment was done, tracking details, and the number of items fulfilled in the order</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546929/original/xLiwvP9rRdAW6QLHUHQ3etUGETVRnHpVVwcbea.jpg?1738039748\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155040546929\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546924/original/NUTbHDpnQgmB-tXHjX6hDSPbdqjPhm6N2Qbe4c.jpg?1738039747\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155040546924\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 class=\"line\" id=\"Additional-notes-while-creating-an-online-store\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(26, 21, 35); margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; display: block; word-break: break-word; text-align: start;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1699373914776\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Additional notes while creating an online store</strong></h3><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; line-height: 17px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 14px; list-style: outside decimal; color: rgb(26, 21, 35); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; text-align: start;\"><li class=\"tdfocus-1699373918892\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">Only one-time products will be included in the online store. Businesses can still sell recurring products using funnels and order forms</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">Automates sales receipts, Order Submitted trigger, Shopping cart element inside email builder to auto-populate line items purchased, Payments received trigger, and coupon codes will automatically work with any online store created</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">All existing products will not be available in the online store by default. Businesses can choose which products they would want to showcase in the store and turn the toggle on for those respective products</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">Businesses will be able to track the orders submitted, payments received, initiate any refunds, etc using the&nbsp;<div class=\"inlineCodeBlock\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; padding: 2px 6px; border: 0px; display: inline; font-family: &quot;Roboto Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 6px;\">Orders</div>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<div class=\"inlineCodeBlock\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 2px 6px; border: 0px; display: inline; font-family: &quot;Roboto Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 6px;\">Transactions</div>&nbsp;lists under the Payments menu</li></ol><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions-(FAQs)\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 2em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1699373923806\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></h1><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 id=\"Can-I-sell-recurring-products-in-my-online-store?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1699373927967\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Can I sell recurring products in my online store?</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1699373935618\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Yes, you can sell both one-time &amp; recurring products in the online store</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"I-have-created-a-store-for-test-purposes.-How-do-I-delete-it-now?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1699373949547\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">I have created a store for test purposes. How do I delete it now?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1699373952662\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Users-will-be-able-to-delete-a-store-by-deleting-any-of-the-automatically-added-pages.-If-they-confirm,-all-data-related-to-the-store-will-be-lostIs-it-possible-to-have-different-pricing-for-different-variants-of-a-product?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Users will be able to delete a store by deleting any of the automatically added pages. If they confirm, all data related to the store will be lost<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155040546927/original/y8qyJJnk0FMY3uymxSxd1XTm1a1wFdQLKgcbea.jpg?1738039748\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155040546927\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1699373962911\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Is it possible to have different pricing for different variants of a product?</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1699373952662\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Yes, users will be able to customize the price of each variant configured. By default, the price of each variant will be the price of the product</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1699373967119\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1699373971526\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-do-I-mark-the-orders-created-as-fulfilled?-How-do-I-share-shipment-details-with-my-customer?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1699373967486\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">How do I mark the orders created as fulfilled? How do I share shipment details with my customer?</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1699373971526\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Users will be able to Fulfill items inside the order details and attach a tracking number/URL to automatically send shipping updates to their customers. This is not available currently but in the works and will be live shortly.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Can-I-create-multiple-stores-within-the-same-location?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1699373979495\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Can I create multiple stores within the same location?</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1699373985696\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Yes, you will be able to create multiple stores within the same location.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006855-how-to-use-the-email-builder-and-its-in-line-editor", "title": "How to use the Email Builder and its In-line Editor", "folder": "Email Builder Capabilities", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345894/original/XQX5OQwN1cPkfDLVBZfyQ_UF4LeLeIKjnQ6c83.jpg?1761938161", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345891/original/iA1ee1NniFzC4i0MG-w0qFzFBt03ENunyQ42b7.jpg?1761938155", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345883/original/KAlpJcuJlFjrVi2WvUhpupBbXBuYxedtPw726c.jpg?1761938146", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345872/original/xmTTAU8OtHCOPb8o1wpCfxlI-rWvv6DiXA6663.png?1761938135", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345907/original/fjVwGDmhgQFOBxpwnoXqVcQi6gFEB17SEQf708.jpg?1761938188", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345859/original/iGONsP69TNscmN-jXtlmiSvN_WeOnR4YVw16b6.png?1761938129", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345874/original/Z150gh1IDQHuIJM-gEj3zRlX-XDx_5S3CQ6663