-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345874/original/Z150gh1IDQHuIJM-gEj3zRlX-XDx_5S3CQ6663.png?1761938135\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155057345874\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1685714237964\" data-identifyelement=\"750\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">These functionalities are designed to give you complete control over your email's design, from the individual components to the overall look and feel.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"751\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"752\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"753\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"754\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Adding Elements</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1685714244492\" data-identifyelement=\"755\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Clicking on the 'Add Elements' button creates a comprehensive list of content types you can add to your email. Here's a brief description of each:</p><p data-identifyelement=\"756\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"757\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1685714251465\" data-identifyelement=\"758\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1em;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"759\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Text:&nbsp;</strong></h4><p class=\"tdfocus-1685714251465\" data-identifyelement=\"760\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">This versatile element can be used for headings, paragraphs, captions, and more. With the inline editor, you can fine-tune every text aspect, from the font style to the color and alignment.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345828/original/oTzv-6hAsc5ykGQgt49fEAczCdtBrGUMJw9896.png?1761938119\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155057345828\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057345845/original/qrhV80AVXWhO32wqIvsw7JvLgOydDQswjA578c.png?1761938123\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155057345845\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"763\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"764\" style=