div class=\"line\" data-identifyelement=\"540\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; border: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">The click performance report would have all individual links and overview details.</div><div class=\"line\" data-identifyelement=\"541\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; border: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057354545/original/PsfE-kJ7uETFujBP9IjZjKQrONVynW0WPQ05db.jpg?1761974765\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155057354545\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></div><ol data-identifyelement=\"543\" start=\"6\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; line-height: 17px; border: 0px; font-size: 14px; list-style: outside decimal; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"544\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Click on individual links to view contact-specific click details.</li></ol><h2 data-identifyelement=\"547\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"FAQs\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057354540/original/uuh0vpZkOvnVPH4opMY2YhtCwOZpSviR8A05db.jpg?1761974765\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155057354540\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"549\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">FAQs</strong></h2><h3 data-identifyelement=\"550\" id=\"Does-it-work-for-all-campaigns?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"551\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Does it work for all campaigns?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"552\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">No, click tracking does not work for RSS and A/B testing campaigns as now, we are working on it.<br data-identifyelement=\"553\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"554\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"555\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Would-custom-value-or-trigger-links-work?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"556\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Would custom value or trigger links work?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"557\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Custom values are supported with click tracking. However, trigger links are not supported yet.<br data-identifyelement=\"558\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"559\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"560\" id=\"Would-campaigns-executed-through-workflows-show-these-metrics?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"561\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Would campaigns executed through workflows show these metrics?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"562\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">No, click tracking is not supporting automated campaigns executed through workflows. As of now, this feature is working for use with standard email marketing campaigns only.</p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"560\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Would-it-work-for-all-campaigns?No,-the-current-implementation-would-not-show-any-results-in-Click-Performance-tab-for-those-emails-sent-before-13th-June,-2024-or-for-those-email-campaigns-where-you-have-not-enabled-the-option-to-track.&nbsp;\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"533\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"561\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Would it work for all campaigns?</strong><br data-identifyelement=\"534\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"535\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">No, the current implementation would not show any results in Click Performance tab for those emails sent before 13th June, 2024 or for those email campaigns where you have not enabled the option to track.&nbsp;</span></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"562\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"536\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden juice:-ml-3\" data-identifyelement=\"563\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\" data-identifyelement=\"564\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex items-center\" data-identifyelement=\"565\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"566\" data-state=\"closed\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><div class=\"flex items-center pb-0.5 juice:pb-0\" data-identifyelement=\"567\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"568\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"></div></span></div></div></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001222861-wp-file-manager-plugin-stable-alternative-for-ftp-access-", "title": "WP File Manager Plugin (Stable Alternative for FTP Access)", "folder": "WordPress Folder", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48253646254/original/XE5sIAcZXp3SIio_9oW2qGgZbMrW6csYuw1852.gif?1664367408"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"498\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"563\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">A WordPress file manager is a plugin that enables users to perform file management tasks from the WordPress dashboard. Instead of logging in to your control panel or File Transfer Protocol (FTP) client, you can access the WordPress website files from a single location.</span><br data-identifyelement=\"499\"><br data-identifyelement=\"500\"></p><h3 class=\"fd-toc\" data-identifyelement=\"501\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"502\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"564\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Covered in this Article:</span></strong><span data-identifyelement=\"565\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"504\"></span></h3><h3 data-identifyelement=\"505\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"566\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"506\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Why-use-this-plugin-instead-of-having-FTP-Access?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"507\">Why use this plugin instead of having FTP Access?</strong></a></span></h3><h3 data-identifyelement=\"508\"><a data-identifyelement=\"509\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-install-the-WP-file-manager-plugin?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"510\"><span data-identifyelement=\"567\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">How to install the WP file manager plugin?</span></strong></a></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"511\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"512\"><br data-identifyelement=\"513\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"514\"><h2 data-identifyelement=\"515\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Why-use-this-plugin-instead-of-having-FTP-Access?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"516\" dir=\"ltr\">Why use this plugin instead of having FTP Access?</strong></h2><h2 data-identifyelement=\"517\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\"><br data-identifyelement=\"518\"></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"519\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"568\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FTP is inherently a non-secure way to transfer data. When a file is sent using this protocol, the data, username, and password are all shared in plain text, which means a hacker can access this information with little to no effort.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"520\" style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"569\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"521\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"522\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"570\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">WP File Manager provides an intuitive user interface with a clear structure pane and display.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"571\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The plugin is free to download and use, but you need to purchase a license to access its advanced features such as private folder creation and control file operations for different user roles. These are useful if you have a team managing multiple websites.</span><br data-identifyelement=\"524\"><br data-identifyelement=\"525\"><br data-identifyelement=\"526\"><br data-identifyelement=\"527\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"528\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-install-the-WP-file-manager-plugin?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"529\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">How to install the WP file manager plugin?</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"530\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"531\"><span data-identifyelement=\"572\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">You can install this plugin by going to your Plugins tab in the WP admin view like this:</span><br data-identifyelement=\"532\"><br data-identifyelement=\"533\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48253646254/original/XE5sIAcZXp3SIio_9oW2qGgZbMrW6csYuw1852.gif?1664367408\" style=\"width: 511px;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48253646254\" data-identifyelement=\"534\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"535\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"536\"><br data-identifyelement=\"537\"><span data-identifyelement=\"573\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1. Go to your WP Admin view<br data-identifyelement=\"538\">2. Click on Plugins<br data-identifyelement=\"539\">3. Click on Add New<br data-identifyelement=\"540\">4. Search for WP File Manager. Select the one shown in the gif above.<br data-identifyelement=\"541\">5. Install and activate it.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"542\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"574\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"543\"><u>You can read more about this plugin here:</u></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"544\" style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"575\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"545\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-file-manager/\" dir=\"ltr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-identifyelement=\"546\"></a></strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-file-manager/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" data-identifyelement=\"547\"></a><a data-identifyelement=\"548\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-file-manager/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-file-manager/</a><br data-identifyelement=\"549\"><br data-identifyelement=\"550\"><br data-identifyelement=\"551\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"552\" dir=\"ltr\">Please Note:</strong></span></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" data-identifyelement=\"553\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"576\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Just like the dangers with FTP access, if you are not careful with what kind of file you are handling using this plugin, it could still cause issues.<br data-identifyelement=\"554\"><br data-identifyelement=\"555\">Please restore your WordPress to your most recent stable backup if you come across any issues.</span></pre>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000005095-how-to-set-up-call-tracking-number-pool-", "title": "How to Set Up Call Tracking (Number Pool)", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045244064/original/O4F-RxV9b1DaJJ0RHLumeTpNlSKPwYuwiA7ec8.png?1744874425", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045244102/original/OU-_I5H2mKuS22QvZFokLCKkeo7UjT9U2A5e95.jpg?1744874427", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045244059/original/AqrBEzXrD07sq_nNPsg_DOOM0JGzNw8ltw7ec8.png?1744874425", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045244083/original/jhCEYXcb0ZB61t6bB4j8jNFMIgjso86_Nw0bc6.png?1744874426", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155045244085/original/nLxT6AvwBTK7Pqq-RT7qQL8xTlLwjU9MHA0bc6.png?1744874426", "../..