ing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Add the <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">name of Facebook form</strong></span></span><br><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046108771/original/TJsJSv2fHUl2rdg--mt1lcE4DJGGRj5bIwa3ea.png?1746440788\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155046108771\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></strong></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">Select the form type option off the two- <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">More Volume and Higher Intent&nbsp;</strong>- Difference is that Higher Intent adds a review step to view the information for people to confirm.</span><br><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046108765/original/HfXywcOjTD2RUGJt-Ka8_dOREuhOl8XWLgb9af.png?1746440786\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; displ